+
+Part 7 kan fiha Booking `PENDING → CONFIRMED | REJECTED | UNCERTAIN`, recovery job b PostgreSQL, OAuth2 machine identity, Gateway, Redis. Daba Part 7.5 katzid **business lifecycle + proof under concurrency**:
